 "rows_L2": [
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r1",
   "version": "P_step4",
   "run": "r1",
   "group": "K4_ro_insns",
   "verdict": "real",
   "location": "arch/riscv/net/bpf_jit_core.c:bpf_int_jit_compile",
   "issue": "从未给 ctx->ro_insns 赋值（应为 jit_data->image），它保持 NULL，导致 bpf_func、extable、PC 相对计算全部基于 NULL"
  },
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r1",
   "version": "P_step4",
   "run": "r1",
   "group": "K3_rv32_text_copy",
   "verdict": "real",
   "location": "arch/riscv/net/bpf_jit_comp64.c:bpf_arch_text_copy / bpf_arch_text_invalidate（P2）",
   "issue": "RV32 变体没有实现 bpf_arch_text_copy 和 bpf_arch_text_invalidate，但共享的 bpf_jit_core.c 已改成 pack 流程，RV32 的 JIT 会全部失败"
  },
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r1",
   "version": "P_step4",
   "run": "r1",
   "group": "text_poke_lockdep",
   "verdict": "real",
   "location": "arch/riscv/net/bpf_jit_comp64.c:bpf_arch_text_poke",
   "issue": "函数开头 lockdep_assert_held(&text_mutex)，但调用者并不持有该锁，随后函数内部又自己 mutex_lock(&text_mutex)"
  },
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r1",
   "version": "P_step4",
   "run": "r1",
   "group": "jit_free_finalize",
   "verdict": "same_as_reference",
   "location": "arch/riscv/net/bpf_jit_core.c:bpf_jit_free",
   "issue": "jit_data 存在时 finalize 失败后，仍继续对同一个 ro 镜像再做一次 pack_free，造成重复释放"
  },
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r1",
   "version": "P_step4",
   "run": "r1",
   "group": "jited_before_finalize",
   "verdict": "same_as_reference",
   "location": "arch/riscv/net/bpf_jit_core.c:bpf_int_jit_compile",
   "issue": "finalize 失败时，prog 已被置为 jited，bpf_func 指向已释放的镜像，没有回滚"
  },
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r1",
   "version": "P_step4",
   "run": "r1",
   "group": "kzalloc_whole",
   "verdict": "real",
   "location": "arch/riscv/kernel/patch.c:patch_text_set_nosync",
   "issue": "失效时按整个 len 一次性 kzalloc，而 len 可达整个 pack（hdr->size），大块连续内存可能分配失败且没有退路"
  },
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r1",
   "version": "P_step4",
   "run": "r1",
   "group": "patch_map_strict_module_rwx",
   "verdict": "real",
   "location": "arch/riscv/kernel/patch.c:patch_map / patch_insn_write",
   "issue": "在 !CONFIG_STRICT_MODULE_RWX 时 patch_map 直接返回 addr，但 pack 内存已经被 set_memory_rox 设为只读，直接写会失败"
  },
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r2",
   "version": "P_step4",
   "run": "r2",
   "group": "text_poke_lockdep",
   "verdict": "real",
   "location": "arch/riscv/net/bpf_jit_comp64.c:bpf_arch_text_poke",
   "issue": "函数开头 lockdep_assert_held(&text_mutex)，之后又 mutex_lock(&text_mutex)。调用者（trampoline.c 的 register_fentry、arraymap.c 等）并不持有 text_mutex，所以每次调用都会触发 lockdep 警告；如果调用者真的持锁，又会死锁。"
  },
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r2",
   "version": "P_step4",
   "run": "r2",
   "group": "K4_ro_insns",
   "verdict": "real",
   "location": "arch/riscv/net/bpf_jit_core.c:bpf_int_jit_compile",
   "issue": "ctx->ro_insns 在 JIT 流程中从未被设置为 jit_data->image。它保持为 NULL（kzalloc），所以 prog->bpf_func、extable、emit_addr/emit_call 的 PC 相对计算和异常表偏移全部基于 NULL。"
  },
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r2",
   "version": "P_step4",
   "run": "r2",
   "group": "K3_rv32_text_copy",
   "verdict": "real",
   "location": "arch/riscv/net/bpf_jit_comp32.c / bpf_jit_core.c",
   "issue": "RV32 没有实现 bpf_arch_text_copy 和 bpf_arch_text_invalidate，公共的 bpf_int_jit_compile 又改成了 pack 流程。weak 默认实现会让 finalize 必然失败，RV32 的 JIT 无法工作；comp32 也不使用 ro_insns。"
  },
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r2",
   "version": "P_step4",
   "run": "r2",
   "group": "jited_before_finalize",
   "verdict": "same_as_reference",
   "location": "arch/riscv/net/bpf_jit_core.c:bpf_int_jit_compile",
   "issue": "finalize 失败时已经释放了 RO pack 和 RW 头，但 prog->jited=1 和 bpf_func 已经设置。当 prog 未被 blinding 时 prog==orig_prog，之后 bpf_jit_free 会按 jited 再次释放 pack，造成 double free。x86 对这种情况是 BUG_ON。"
  },
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r2",
   "version": "P_step4",
   "run": "r2",
   "group": "jited_before_finalize",
   "verdict": "same_as_reference",
   "location": "arch/riscv/net/bpf_jit_core.c:bpf_jit_free",
   "issue": "jit_data 存在时对保留的 header 调用 finalize，与 x86 做法不一致（x86 是直接 pack_free）。finalize 失败时它已经释放了 RO pack 和 RW 头，但 header 指针没有清空，且后面仍按 prog->jited 再次 pack_free，重复释放。jit_data->header 为 NULL 时 finalize 还会解引用空指针。"
  },
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r2",
   "version": "P_step4",
   "run": "r2",
   "group": "kzalloc_whole",
   "verdict": "real",
   "location": "arch/riscv/kernel/patch.c:patch_text_set_nosync",
   "issue": "为了填充零，按 len 整体 kzalloc。invalidate 的 len 可达 pack 大小（最大 2MB），大块分配可能失败，且没有退路（如分页填充）。失败时 pack 位图仍被清除，残留旧代码可被执行。kzalloc 之后又 memset，也是冗余。"
  },
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r3",
   "version": "P_step4",
   "run": "r3",
   "group": "K4_ro_insns",
   "verdict": "real",
   "location": "arch/riscv/net/bpf_jit_core.c:bpf_int_jit_compile",
   "issue": "ctx->ro_insns 在 bpf_int_jit_compile 中从未被赋值（jit_data 为 kzalloc，恒为 NULL），导致 bpf_func 为 NULL、PC 相对计算和异常表地址全部错误"
  },
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r3",
   "version": "P_step4",
   "run": "r3",
   "group": "text_poke_lockdep",
   "verdict": "real",
   "location": "arch/riscv/net/bpf_jit_comp64.c:bpf_arch_text_poke",
   "issue": "函数开头新增 lockdep_assert_held(&text_mutex)，但函数后面又自己 mutex_lock(&text_mutex)：调用者未持锁时触发 lockdep 警告，持锁时则自死锁"
  },
  {
   "call": "L2_P_step4_r3",
